(function(){var A={"b_intro":{"t":"This is a token board for the bus ride. It rides along with your learner, and the bus staff use it the same way on every trip.","d":8.011,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_rules":{"t":"Across the top are your learner's own bus rules, each with a picture, so everyone can see what earns a token. Two to four rules work best.","d":9.419,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_item":{"t":"Before the ride, your learner picks something to work for, and it goes in the Earn box, so the goal is in sight the whole way.","d":7.477,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_route":{"t":"This is the route, drawn simply, from the start of the ride to the stop. The form takes the usual length of the ride, which you can check in Maps.","d":9.269,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_spread":{"t":"The form spreads the tokens over the ride. It divides the time by the number of tokens, so the last token comes a minute or two before the stop, just as your learner gets close to the item.","d":12.235,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_fixed":{"t":"Here the tokens come at a set interval, such as every few minutes. On a long ride the board can fill more than once, with an exchange each time it is full.","d":9.888,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_start":{"t":"To start, the bus staff use a timer set to the checkpoint times on the plan. A vibrating watch is easy to use on a noisy bus. The timer here is sped up for this video.","d":12.064,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_tok":{"t":"At each checkpoint, if your learner followed the rules since the last one, give a token right away, with brief praise that names the rule. Let your learner put it on the board.","d":10.912,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_none":{"t":"If a rule is not followed, that checkpoint earns no token, but the earned tokens stay. Calmly name the rule once, and the next checkpoint is a fresh chance.","d":10.379,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_each":{"t":"With a row for each rule, every rule earns its own token at each checkpoint. A missed rule leaves only its own slot empty, and the other rules still earn.","d":10.528,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_more":{"t":"The bus rolls on, and each checkpoint with the rules followed earns another token. The board fills up along the way.","d":7.435,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_last":{"t":"The last token comes just before the stop. The board is full, and your learner has earned the item.","d":6.347,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_full":{"t":"When the last slot is filled, the board is full, and your learner has earned the item. On a long ride, the board then starts again.","d":8.224,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_arrive":{"t":"At the stop, the board goes with your learner to the adult who meets the bus. That adult sees the full board and gives the item right away.","d":8.885,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_onbus":{"t":"When the board is full, your learner gets the item right there on the bus. Something small and quick works best. Check the district\u2019s rules before using food on the bus.","d":10.507,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_land":{"t":"Once the board is working, fade the timer. Use landmarks along the route as the checkpoints instead: places your learner can see from the window, in the order the bus passes them.","d":11.573,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_fewer":{"t":"Then use fewer checkpoints: every other landmark, and later just the stop. If the rides get harder, go back a step.","d":7.477,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_plan":{"t":"The form prints a ride plan for the bus staff, with the route, the checkpoints, what to say, and a log to fill in after each ride.","d":8.117,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"b_outro":{"t":"Same board, same rules, every ride. Over time, the rides should go more smoothly, with fewer tokens needed.","d":7.584,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"}};if(typeof WALK_AUDIO==='undefined')window.WALK_AUDIO={voice:"af_heart",speed:0.88,lines:A};else Object.assign(WALK_AUDIO.lines,A);})();
